u(up)`, `gate * up`, `down * (gate * up)`,
`routed + shared`, `shared_gate * shared`, `sigmoid(shared_gate * shared) * shared`, `routed + sigmoid * shared`).
`moe_topk` is `topk(softmax(logits))` with `w /= sum(w)` (the `norm_topk` attribute).

